  "description": "Shark Meow is an orange tabby kitty who wears a shark suit.<br>\nA little clumsy and always taking things at their own cozy pace,<br>\nbut every day with their best kitty friends — and the rescued baby kitty, Little Meow —<br>\nis filled with unexpected little mishaps and sweet adventures.<br><br>\n \nA sunny warm spot in the park, the sparkle of the sea,<br>\nsteam rising from freshly roasted sweet potatoes,<br>\nthe fluttery feeling of the first snowfall…<br>\nThese small everyday moments fill their world with warmth and delight.\n <br><br>\nYou can’t help but smile and think, “So true!”<br>\nA soft and snuggly kitty anime that brings joy to everyday moments.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: QTORY Channel)",
